---
import Container from "../../common/Container.astro";
---

<section class="problem-section">
    <Container>
        <div class="problem-section__content">
            <h2 class="problem-section__title">
                The real problem is not a lack of<br />
                AI tools.
            </h2>

            <div class="problem-section__statement">
                <p>
                    It is not knowing where they will create worthwhile business
                    value.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="problem-section__copy">
                <p>
                    Many businesses are <strong>experimenting with AI</strong> while
                    the workflows that affect daily operations remain slow, manual
                    and difficult to track.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Staff spend time chasing information. Work becomes blocked.
                    Managers lack visibility. Experienced people handle repetitive
                    administrative tasks. New tools are considered without a clear
                    business case.
                </p>

                <p>
                    <strong>ArkSystems starts with the workflow</strong>—not the
                    technology.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="problem-section__grid">
                <article class="problem-card">
	<span class="problem-card__icon material-symbols-rounded" aria-hidden="true">
		schedule
	</span>

                    <div>
                        <h3>Work keeps getting delayed</h3>
                        <p>
                            Missing information, unclear handoffs and repeated follow-up
                            prevent work from moving forward.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="problem-card">
	<span class="problem-card__icon material-symbols-rounded" aria-hidden="true">
			work_history
	</span>

                    <div>
                        <h3>Staff capacity is being consumed</h3>
                        <p>
                            Experienced employees spend valuable time on repetitive
                            coordination and administrative work.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="problem-card">
	<span class="problem-card__icon material-symbols-rounded" aria-hidden="true">
		visibility_off
	</span>

                    <div>
                        <h3>Leaders cannot see what is blocked</h3>
                        <p>
                            Status information is scattered across email, spreadsheets,
                            software and individual team members.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="problem-card">
	<span class="problem-card__icon material-symbols-rounded" aria-hidden="true">
		psychology_alt
	</span>

                    <div>
                        <h3>Technology decisions become uncertain</h3>
                        <p>
                            Businesses know AI matters, but they do not know which
                            opportunity is valuable, feasible or worth the investment.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Container>
</section>

<style>
    .problem-section {
        padding-block: var(--section-padding-y);
        border-top: 1px solid rgb(79 84 64 / 5%);
    }

    .problem-section__content {
        max-width: 69rem;
        margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .problem-section__title {
        max-width: 37rem;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
        line-height: 1.08;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: var(--color-neutral-900);
    }

    .problem-section__statement {
        max-width: 41rem;
        margin-top: 1.6rem;
        padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem;
        border-left: 3px solid var(--color-brand-700);
        border-radius: 0 0.3rem 0.3rem 0;
        background: rgb(241 240 229 / 72%);
    }

    .problem-section__statement p {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-heading);
        font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.6vw, 1.35rem);
        font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
        line-height: 1.35;
        color: var(--color-brand-900);
    }

    .problem-section__copy {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.35rem;
        max-width: 56rem;
        margin-top: 1.8rem;
    }

    .problem-section__copy p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--color-neutral-700);
    }

    .problem-section__copy strong {
        font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
        color: var(--color-brand-800);
    }

    .problem-section__grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 1.25rem;
        margin-top: 3.25rem;
    }

    .problem-card {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 1.15rem;
        min-height: 9.5rem;
        padding: 1.75rem 1.9rem;
        border: 1px solid rgb(79 84 64 / 13%);
        border-radius: 0.55rem;
        background: rgb(255 253 248 / 74%);
        box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgb(58 63 46 / 3%);
    }

    .problem-card__icon {
        display: grid;
        width: 2.5rem;
        height: 2.5rem;
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        place-items: center;
        border-radius: 0.65rem;
        background: var(--color-brand-100);
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        color: var(--color-brand-700);
    }

    .problem-card h3 {
        margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
        line-height: 1.4;
        color: var(--color-neutral-900);
    }

    .problem-card p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.94rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--color-neutral-700);
    }

    @media (max-width: 62rem) {
        .problem-section__content {
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        .problem-section__title br {
            display: none;
        }

        .problem-section__grid {
            margin-top: 2.75rem;
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 44rem) {
        .problem-section {
            padding-block: var(--section-padding-y-mobile);
        }

        .problem-section__title {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 9vw, 2.5rem);
        }

        .problem-section__statement {
            margin-top: 1.4rem;
            padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
        }

        .problem-section__copy {
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .problem-section__grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 2.5rem;
        }

        .problem-card {
            gap: 1rem;
            padding: 1.4rem;
        }

        .problem-card__icon {
            width: 2.25rem;
            height: 2.25rem;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
        }
    }
</style>